cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or the aggregated data, please cite it using the
  metadata below.
type: software
title: "CHOMP: Claims History of Oral Healthcare Medicaid Procedures"
abstract: >-
  Pipeline and interactive map that link the HHS Medicaid Provider Spending
  release (2018-2024) to NPPES practice locations and aggregate dental claims,
  beneficiaries, and payments by CDT category at the state, county, and
  three-digit ZIP code levels.
